# Al-Moayed (المؤيد) Spec Kit

**Read first:** `.speckit/spec.yaml` · `.speckit/constitution.md`

## Product

Arabic RTL PWA for all educational levels and subjects. Stack: Next.js 14 App Router, Supabase, iron-session, Tailwind, Shadcn/UI.

## Implemented features (do not break)

- **AUTH-001/002/003** — WhatsApp login, teacher code, session lock
- **MT-001/002** — Multi-tenant `student_teachers`, teacher switcher
- **QUIZ-001** — Gatekeeper: no answers/explanations until submit
- **QUIZ-002/003** — Weak points + WhatsApp share
- **GAMIF-001** — Teacher level tiers + student progress/badges (active teacher)
- **GAMIF-002** — Default gamification preset loader on teacher settings
- **TIER-001/002** — Pro gating + upgrade approval
- **TEACH-001–005** — Students, groups, quizzes, bulk import, dashboard stats
- **UI-001/002** — RTL mobile shell, StatusBadge
- **UI-006** — Header-edge nav progress (`NavbarProgress`, Tailwind `animate-pulse`)
- **UI-007** — Results card score badge + action layout
- **ENABLE-001** — `data-spekit` hooks via `src/lib/spekit-targets.ts`

## Code rules

1. Scope queries to active `currentTeacherId` for teacher data.
2. Quiz exam API: never return grading fields pre-submission.
3. RTL + touch-friendly UI; no raw native selects/files in new UI.
4. Server Actions only for DB writes; admin Supabase client.
5. Minimal focused diffs; match existing patterns.

## Spekit hooks

Add new targets to `SPEKIT` constant + `.speckit/spekit-targets.yaml`. Use `{...spekit(SPEKIT.id)}` or `data-spekit={SPEKIT.id}`.

## Verify

`npm run build` after changes. Update `.speckit/spec.yaml` when behavior changes.
